    "updated_at": "2021-02-21T03:29:42Z",
    "body": "I think this is an issue with certain multiwidth emoji: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/54451605/how-can-i-properly-use-two-character-width-emoji-in-my-bash-prompt\r\n\r\nIn fish, this would be fixed by setting `fish_emoji_width`, but I've been unable to find out if there's some equivalent in bash.",
